"Install the app (the CLI ships inside it), or use Homebrew: brew install --cask huynhtrungthoai/cleanpilot/cleanpilot, which also puts /opt/homebrew/bin/diskwise on your PATH." = "Cài app (CLI nằm sẵn bên trong), hoặc dùng Homebrew: brew install --cask huynhtrungthoai/cleanpilot/cleanpilot — lệnh này cũng đưa /opt/homebrew/bin/diskwise vào PATH.";
